Participation Schedule for Quarterly Validated Advance Recovery

Incorporate policy "sv-receipt-validation@1".
Incorporate policy "sv-posting-cost-validation@1".
Incorporate policy "money-rounding@1".
Account for each calendar quarter.
Require Settlement Scope matches Recovery Ledger or fail "ADVANCE_SCOPE_MISMATCH".
Require Settlement Period starts at Prior Close or fail "ADVANCE_PERIOD_DISCONTINUITY".
Require Available Advance Balance >= USD 0 or fail "ADVANCE_NEGATIVE_OPENING".
Require Receipts pass Validation or fail "RECEIPTS_NOT_VALIDATED".
Require Posted Costs pass Validation or fail "POSTING_COSTS_NOT_VALIDATED".
Gross Receipts are the sum of admitted receipts.
Posted Costs are the sum of admitted posted costs.
Net Receipts are Gross Receipts less Posted Costs.
Require Net Receipts >= USD 0 or fail "ADVANCE_NEGATIVE_BASIS".
For settlement with Artist:
  Selected Participation Rate is the highest applicable rate.
  Unrounded Participation is Selected Participation Rate of Net Receipts.
  Earned Participation is the unrounded participation rounded to cents.
  Recouped Advance is the lesser of Earned Participation and Available Advance Balance.
  Participation Payable is Earned Participation less Recouped Advance.
  Closing Recovery Ledger is the ledger updated at close.
  Report "pool": Agreement, Participant, Pool, Settlement Period, Net Receipts, Selected Participation Rate, Earned Participation, Recouped Advance, Participation Payable.

Bindings:
  Schedule QuarterlyValidatedAdvanceRecovery.
  Using language "spl/0.1-draft" core "spl-core/0.1-draft" schema "spl-data/0.1-draft".
  input receipts: List<SVReceipt>;
  input costs: List<SVPostingCost>;
  input scope: SettlementScope;
  input launch_approved: Bool;
  opening ledger: {agreement_id: Id<Agreement>, participant_id: Id<Participant>, pool_id: Id<Pool>, next_start: Date, balance: Money<USD>} from "verification/advance-recovery";
  Settle "Artist" with scope.participant_id.
  Bind "calendar quarter" to scope.period.
  Bind "Settlement Scope matches Recovery Ledger" to scope.agreement_id == ledger.agreement_id and scope.participant_id == ledger.participant_id and scope.pool_id == ledger.pool_id.
  Bind "Settlement Period starts at Prior Close" to scope.period.start == ledger.next_start.
  Bind "Available Advance Balance" to ledger.balance.
  Bind "Receipts pass Validation" to validate_receipts(receipts, scope.period).
  Bind "Posted Costs pass Validation" to validate_posting_costs(costs, scope.period).
  Bind "Gross Receipts" to gross_receipts.
  Bind "the sum of admitted receipts" to sum(receipts, receipt => receipt.amount).
  Bind "Posted Costs" to posted_costs.
  Bind "the sum of admitted posted costs" to sum(costs, cost => cost.amount).
  Bind "Net Receipts" to net_receipts.
  Bind "Selected Participation Rate" to selected_rate.
  Bind "the highest applicable rate" to choose priority { rule "launch" priority 20 when launch_approved => 0.50; rule "volume" priority 10 when net_receipts >= USD 0.10 => 0.25; otherwise "base" => 0.10; }.
  Bind "Unrounded Participation" to unrounded_participation.
  Bind "Earned Participation" to earned_participation.
  Bind "the unrounded participation rounded to cents" to round_usd(unrounded_participation, USD 0.01, "half_even").
  Bind "Recouped Advance" to recouped_advance.
  Bind "Participation Payable" to participation_payable.
  Bind "Recovery Ledger" to ledger.
  Bind "the ledger updated at close" to {agreement_id: ledger.agreement_id, participant_id: ledger.participant_id, pool_id: ledger.pool_id, next_start: scope.period.end, balance: ledger.balance - recouped_advance}.
  Bind "Agreement" to scope.agreement_id.
  Bind "Participant" to settlement_participant.
  Bind "Pool" to scope.pool_id.
  Bind "Settlement Period" to scope.period.
  Field "Agreement" as agreement_id.
  Field "Participant" as participant_id.
  Field "Pool" as pool_id.
  Field "Settlement Period" as period.
  Field "Net Receipts" as basis.
  Field "Selected Participation Rate" as rate.
  Field "Earned Participation" as earned.
  Field "Recouped Advance" as recouped.
  Field "Participation Payable" as payable.
